---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Us">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose prose-lg">
    <h1>About Us</h1>
    <p>Welcome to OnlineJobsReveiws.co.ke, your number one source for all things related to making money online in Kenya. We're dedicated to giving you the very best of online job reviews, with a focus on legitimacy, payment proof, and local relevance.</p>
    
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>Our mission is to empower Kenyans to achieve financial independence through legitimate online opportunities. We test, review, and verify every platform we feature to ensure it actually pays Kenyans via M-Pesa, PayPal, or local banks.</p>
    
    <h2>Why Trust Us?</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Local Focus:</strong> We don't just copy global reviews. We test if the platform works specifically for Kenyans.</li>
      <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> We clearly state the pros and cons, including withdrawal limits and fees.</li>
      <li><strong>Community Driven:</strong> Our reviews are updated based on feedback from thousands of Kenyan users.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to contact us via our Contact Us page.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>